Z||000000||Philphine||07-07-2001||07:19 PM||||<BR>i was down dixie hy-way and saw a white '85 gt by the road so i stopped to look. no one there so it's just observation, but it looked good. 69,000mls. i'm assuming it hasn't turned over 'cause it said low miles on the window. no spoiler but body looked strait, interior looked clean, seats not ripped. $2400. more than i want to pay plus i'm in the middle of trying to get an '86 gt now. i left the addy for here though (hope yall don't mind. guess he could end up just advertising his car and go). the phone # was 502-933-1942 if someones interested.<P>while i was looking at it a red 85gt pulls up and we talk for a bit. he's asking about the body pieces i've got so i keep refering to here as a sourse. also talk engines a bit and i tell him about here and the knowledge to be found. he got his car at a lot that seems to like fieros. about half a block from where this car is. (belgray if you're local) they've always got one or two. he got an auto for $700, but i'm pretty sure the '85 4 speed gt he said was there also was brought by a guy i talked to about a month ago (told him about here too but haven't seen a new local name pop up). small world. he also gave me a line on a fiero at a salvation army lot close by.<P>ok i'm rambling. just sharing my fiero day.     <P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>SERENITY NOW!!!!||||reg||1
